        "id": 7854,
        "name": "lordtokomi",
        "username": "lordtokomi",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/b5e925/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-30T00:12:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Long time lurker and new poster here.&nbsp;</p><p>I think i found the answer to my first question of playing against the Ennead chains. They are the villian that never ends...they go on and on...&nbsp;</p><p>Which brings me to the next set of questions. Is my understanding correct about Elemental Storm and RA/Bunker?</p><p>Random_Ennead_01 playes Elemental &nbsp;Storm which does 1 lightnining 1 Fire and 1 cold damage to RA</p><p>Without damage reduction RA takes three instances of damage for 2 (1 base + 1 nemesis) each for a total of 6 or 1L,IE,1C, and 1N for a total of 4?</p><p>Same card against bunker that has Heavy Plating. Does Bunker take no damage as each instance is reduced to 0?</p><p>Would it be safe to say that nemesis bonus acts as +1 all damage dealt?</p><p>I appreciate the clarity.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:13.956Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
